{"id":"wb-6-392","name":"三圣瑞现塔","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"三圣瑞现塔","text":"三圣瑞现塔位于中国山西省陵川县西河底镇积善村昭庆院内，俗称积善塔，2006年被列为第六批全国重点文物保护单位。\n据塔内第三层碑文记载，三圣瑞现塔始建于隋仁寿元年（601年），后不知毁于何时，金大定六年发现原塔底石龟及舍利，遂重建该塔，大定九年（1169年）竣工。塔为密檐式砖塔，四角十三层，底边长6米，高约30米。塔内空心，可循层攀登而上。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E4%B8%89%E5%9C%A3%E7%91%9E%E7%8E%B0%E5%A1%94","revisionId":85971180,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=85971180","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/75d771e8c4036560d4222330.jpg","title":"三圣瑞现塔（山西晋城）.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:%E4%B8%89%E5%9C%A3%E7%91%9E%E7%8E%B0%E5%A1%94%EF%BC%88%E5%B1%B1%E8%A5%BF%E6%99%8B%E5%9F%8E%EF%BC%89.jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/8/87/%E4%B8%89%E5%9C%A3%E7%91%9E%E7%8E%B0%E5%A1%94%EF%BC%88%E5%B1%B1%E8%A5%BF%E6%99%8B%E5%9F%8E%EF%BC%89.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"Dkzzl","license":"CC0","licenseUrl":"http://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/zero/1.0/deed.en","caption":"​三圣瑞现塔（山西晋城陵川）","width":320,"height":427}}